<title>HONG KONG: China Light appoints McAulay as director.</title>
<headline>China Light appoints McAulay as director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Light &amp; Power Co Ltd said in a statement on Wednesday it appointed Andrew McAulay to its board of directors effective February 1.</p>
<p>McAulay is a nephew of chairman Michael Kadoorie and the son of long-serving director R.J. McAulay, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
